    "description": "Practice 1 15.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MED201 · Assessment 2/6</span>\n<h2>Practice 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 11303 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MED201 · Đầu điểm 2/6</span>\n<h2>Practice 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 11303 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: 15' Option 2:(For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: The whole class is divided into groups. Each group is assigned to choose one topic relating to books, newspapers or magazines Option 2:(For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1Option 1: 1 Option 2:(For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Test the acquainted knowledge which student obtained in the delivered chapt ers(3-4).<br><br>Option 2:(For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1 The whole class is divided into groups. Each group is assigned to choose one topic relating to the content we have learned to create one media product and deliver one presentation about that media product in front of the class for 15 minutes.<br><br>Option 2:(For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1 The mark will be given based on each student's performance, not on the whole group's. It means each student will get their own mark.<br><br>Practice 1,2,3,4:<br><br>The whole class is divided into groups. Each group is assigned to choose one topic relating to the content we have learned to create one media product and deliver one presentation about that media product in front of the class for 15 minutes.<br><br>The media product should demonstrate:<br><br>• That it is a justifiable representation of the theme selected in class<br><br>• The understanding of new media technologies<br><br>• The technique of creating multimedia content.<br><br>• Basic technical media production skills<br><br>The presentation should:<br><br>• Be facilitated in a communicative/commercial way.<br><br>• Be analytical of the topical theme.<br><br>• Direct the participants toward the generation of another theme.<br><br>The presentation/discussion in class is expected to answer student's questions/wonders about what they are not sure, not very things mentioned in the materials.The teacher will summarise the key points and emphasize what students have to keep in mind while making use of new media technologies.<br><br>Option 2:(For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=MED201\">Exam Room — MED201</a> (1 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=MED201\">Phòng thi — MED201</a> (1 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
